WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.974
Idea. Imagine one big pizza. Shared by two friends, each gets a lot. Shared by ten, each gets a thin slice. A country's output works the same way.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:24.422
Two countries each produce one hundred billion dollars. Country A has ten million people, so ten thousand dollars each. Country B has one hundred million people, so only one thousand dollars each.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:37.798
So G D P per capita is G D P divided by the population: the average output per person. First, put both numbers in the same units. One billion is one thousand million.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:51.367
Method. Step one, check the units. Here G D P is four point five billion dollars and the population is three million. Write G D P as four thousand five hundred million.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:01:06.490
Step two, divide G D P by population and write it down. Four thousand five hundred divided by three is one thousand five hundred. Step three, give the currency: one thousand five hundred dollars per person.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:22.745
Worked example. Here is a real question from June 2019. It gives Vietnam's population and G D P in 2016. Calculate G D P per capita to two decimal places. Two marks.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:34.615
Population is ninety-two point seven million. G D P is two hundred and two thousand six hundred million dollars. Both are in millions, so the millions cancel.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:55.551
Two hundred and two thousand six hundred divided by ninety-two point seven is two thousand one hundred and eighty-five point five four four. To two decimal places, that is two thousand one hundred and eighty-five dollars fifty-four. This explanation is by olevels dot com, not an official mark scheme.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:05.101
So on average, each person in Vietnam produced about two thousand one hundred and eighty-five dollars of output in 2016.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:15.956
Common mistake. A common mistake is dividing the wrong way round. Population divided by G D P gives a tiny, meaningless number.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:25.661
Another is mixing billions and millions. Five billion divided by two million is two thousand five hundred dollars, not two dollars fifty.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:40.211
Your turn. Now you try. A country's G D P is thirty-six billion dollars and its population is seven point five million. Calculate its G D P per capita. Pause here and work it out.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:46.948
Answer. First, match the units. Thirty-six billion is thirty-six thousand million.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:57.129
Thirty-six thousand divided by seven point five is four thousand eight hundred. G D P per capita is four thousand eight hundred dollars.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:06.787
Remember: match the units, divide G D P by population, then round and add the currency. Now try the practice questions.
